\end{equation}
where $S^+ = \max(0, \lambda^+_L, \lambda^+_R)$ and $S^- = \min(0, \lambda^-_L, \lambda^-_R)$. The exact fast magnetosonic speed $c_f$ satisfies:
\begin{equation}
